{"id":"n28419-1-6","stage":2,"title":"내다보다 · 向外看","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28419-1-6-1","ko":"너는 엄마가 왔는데 내다보지도 않니?","zh":"你妈妈都来了，你连看都不看一眼吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너는","audio":"/audio/54abca9caefe5ae47b8e.mp3"}},{"text":"엄마가","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄마가","audio":"/audio/2e1aa7412bb8a19dded5.mp3"}},{"text":"왔는데","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왔는데","audio":"/audio/00521fca05afdb9d28ff.mp3"}},{"text":"내다보지도","meaning":"向外看","explanation":"내다보다：向外看；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"내다보다","audio":"/audio/ef39a5607ef98b9f31e5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28419","senseId":"1","lemma":"내다보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내다보지도","audio":"/audio/906ab09535d12e7ed621.mp3"}},{"text":"않니?","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17186","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않니","audio":"/audio/b88940bd6e0a2977df5b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从别的地方移动到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"ef39a5607ef98b9f","term":"내다보다","zh":"向外看","audio":"/audio/ef39a5607ef98b9f31e5.mp3","entryId":"28419","definition":"从里边看外面。","pronunciation":["내ː다보다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"17186","definition":"不做某种行动。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/967c79949e8473dc55a4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n28419-1-6-2","ko":"죄송해요. 컴퓨터 게임을 하느라고 몰랐어요.","zh":"对不起，我一直在玩电脑游戏，没注意到。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"죄송해요.","meaning":"抱歉，愧疚","explanation":"죄송하다：抱歉，愧疚；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"죄송하다","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91763","senseId":"1","lemma":"죄송하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"죄송해요","audio":"/audio/e9f7fd1f9febb8b27ec0.mp3"}},{"text":"컴퓨터","meaning":"电脑","explanation":"컴퓨터：电脑","readings":[{"term":"컴퓨터","audio":"/audio/cff8b01657dff709abdb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72167","senseId":"1","lemma":"컴퓨터","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"컴퓨터","audio":"/audio/cff8b01657dff709abdb.mp3"}},{"text":"게임을","meaning":"游戏，比赛","explanation":"게임：游戏，比赛；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"게임","audio":"/audio/252ac990d27ebe080959.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57276","senseId":"1","lemma":"게임","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게임을","audio":"/audio/ada3317247bf97455951.mp3"}},{"text":"하느라고","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；느라고：说明前一行动所造成的后果，常含因忙于此而顾不上其他事的意思。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하느라고","audio":"/audio/66a50bb74c89fe54cfa5.mp3"}},{"text":"몰랐어요.","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몰랐어요","audio":"/audio/89740e53249dc39b7308.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"656cf6c32585f66d","term":"죄송하다","zh":"抱歉，愧疚","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3","entryId":"91763","definition":"好像犯了错一样感觉十分过意不去。","pronunciation":["죄ː송하다","줴ː송하다"]},{"id":"cff8b01657dff709","term":"컴퓨터","zh":"电脑","audio":"/audio/cff8b01657dff709abdb.mp3","entryId":"72167","definition":"利用电路线快速、准确地处理文件、照片、影像等大量数据的机器。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"252ac990d27ebe08","term":"게임","zh":"游戏，比赛","audio":"/audio/252ac990d27ebe080959.mp3","entryId":"57276","definition":"制定规则、分出胜负的玩法。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ccc97bde801d2e4a8e2f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.62,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=28419","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":89,"sequenceScore":2.4467,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["对不起，我一直在玩电脑游戏，没注意到。","你妈妈都来了，你连看都不看一眼吗？","为什么书不放包里，要拿在胳膊上走呢？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你妈妈都来了，你连看都不看一眼吗？","为什么书不放包里，要拿在胳膊上走呢？","对不起，我一直在玩电脑游戏，没注意到。"],"answer":2}]}
